### Login (JWT for the protected /api/** calls below)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jwt.gate@eh8s.local",
  "password": "eh8s-dev-pass1"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Song pool status without Bearer must be 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/tracks/1/royalty-pool

### Song pool status: proposed splits (royalty_split rows normalized to 10000 bps) + on-chain read
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/tracks/1/royalty-pool
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Build create_royalty_pool as the owner (wallet signs next; 409 if a member has no on-chain profile)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/tracks/1/royalty-pool/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC" }

### A wallet that is neither owner nor WAVE agent is 403
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/tracks/1/royalty-pool/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "walletPubkey": "9ptwWxWj5YQKP3pD5b4UEDksARBzkSQPtS3Kyvjnff4Z" }

### Explicit splits must sum to 10000 bps (400)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/tracks/1/royalty-pool/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "splits": [{ "musicianProfileId": 1, "bps": 9000 }]
}

### Confirm with a signature that is not on DevNet is rejected (400/502, pool stays inactive)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/tracks/1/royalty-pool/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "txSignature": "5VERYfakeSignature1111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111"
}

### Propose a sync license deal: 10.03 USDC -> artist 8.03 / EH8S 2.00
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/sync-deals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackId": 1,
  "licenseeName": "Netflix Mexico",
  "useDescription": "Series trailer, 30 seconds, LATAM",
  "amountUsdc": 10.03
}

> {% client.global.set("dealId", response.body.id); %}

### Amount with more than 2 decimals is 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/sync-deals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "trackId": 1, "licenseeName": "Bad amount", "amountUsdc": 1.005 }

### Sync deals for the song (newest first)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/sync-deals?trackId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pay build before the song pool is activated is 409
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/sync-deals/{{dealId}}/pay/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "walletPubkey": "9ptwWxWj5YQKP3pD5b4UEDksARBzkSQPtS3Kyvjnff4Z" }

### Per-song credits for a musician wallet (empty until a pool is funded)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/song-credits?walletPubkey=YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
